---
title: Workout Tracker
type: app
status: active
created: "2026-07-15"
---

# Workout Tracker

A small workout logging app used as the canonical valid app-spec fixture.

::app[name=workout-tracker port=8080 auth=password]

:::model[name=User]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- email: email [required, unique]
- display_name: string [optional, max=80]
:::

:::model[name=Exercise]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- name: string [required, max=120]
- muscle_group: enum(push, pull, legs, core) [default=push]
:::

:::model[name=WorkoutSet]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- exercise_id: ref(Exercise) [required]
- user_id: ref(User) [required]
- reps: int [required, min=1]
- weight_kg: float [optional]
- logged_at: datetime [required]
:::

:::auth[provider=email]
session: cookie
roles: admin, member
default_role: member
:::

:::route[method=GET path=/]
returns: none
:::

:::route[method=GET path=/api/exercises]
auth: required
returns: list(Exercise)
:::

:::route[method=POST path=/api/sets]
auth: required
returns: WorkoutSet
body: WorkoutSet
:::

:::page[route=/ title=Dashboard]
:::

:::deploy[env=production app=workout-tracker machines=1 memory=512]
:::

::
